    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hl_detail",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 371.25274658203125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "text": "• Bounds concurrent attempts per hostname\n• Non-blocking TryAcquire\n• Cap miss → requeue (short delay)\n• Default: 20 concurrent per host\n• Orthogonal to breaker\n• Process-local (prod: distributed semaphore)",
      "originalText": "• Bounds concurrent attempts per hostname\n• Non-blocking TryAcquire\n• Cap miss → requeue (short delay)\n• Default: 20 concurrent per host\n• Orthogonal to breaker\n• Process-local (prod: distributed semaphore)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
